# A cure reaches the copies: rid of poison or bleed on every machine, and nothing keeps ticking.
# "effect remove" cures like the game (StatusEffectHandler.RemoveAllEffects). Hero 5 slot 0, FF on for the venom cry.

include session_net.coop
A expect teammate contains "dist=" timeout=30
A give cons_flow_venomCry 3
B give item_potion_health_0 10
A ff on

include ff_place.part
A expect useitem cons_flow_venomCry 0.4 contains "used" timeout=6
sleep 2
B expect effects me contains StatusEffect_Poison timeout=5
A expect effects DrovaCoop.Remote contains StatusEffect_Poison timeout=5

# ---- B leaves the cry's cloud (it would re-poison) and cures itself: gone on both machines. ----
B tp -2000,-4700
sleep 2
B effect remove StatusEffect_Poison
B expect effects me !contains StatusEffect_Poison timeout=3
A expect counter statusended >= 1 timeout=5
A expect effects DrovaCoop.Remote !contains StatusEffect_Poison timeout=5

# ---- Nothing ticks once cured. (The poison may have downed B; potions wait for standing.) ----
B expect ai me !contains mode=KnockOut timeout=15
B stance normal
sleep 2
B ai me
B effects me
B useitem item_potion_health_0
sleep 2
B effects me
B health me
sleep 2
B health me
A effects DrovaCoop.Remote
sleep 5
B health me
B effects me
B expect health me cur >= 30 timeout=1
B health me
